1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Would you walk a trail across 3,000 stone pillars?
I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
This is Zhangjiajie, in Hunan, China.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
One park ticket is about $33.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,800
And it stays valid for four days.

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,200
3,000 sandstone pillars, some over 200 metres.

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,600
The walkways run right along the cliffs.

7
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,000
Double-tap if you'd walk the edge.

8
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,400
Or ride the Bailong Elevator: 326 metres, about $9.

9
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,200
★ Expert Tip: go on a weekday — weekends jam the walkways.

10
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,000
Stairs or the glass elevator? Tell me your pick.
